  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening of &apos;&apos;Africa &#xbf; Frontex Intelligence Community (AFIC)&apos;&apos; in the fight against organised crime, in order to address the smuggling of migrants</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The specific objective (outcome) is to increase the analytical, preventive and operational capacities of third countries&apos; authorities in the fight against criminal networks responsible for migrant smuggling and to build meaningful trust and networking amongst key countries and regions that will enable them to cooperate and share information (trans-) regionally while ensuring compliance with human rights and the rule of law.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
